      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "While these things don't bother me or probably most people, having the ability to hide/show these for accessibility and performance reasons (just like we can with avatars) should have been part of the new features from the beginning for those who need them. Especially because being able to toggle these off affects no one but the person using the toggle.",
